# `cfb:research:normalize`). Only the small coverage manifest is tracked.
data/cfb/research/raw/
data/cfb/research/normalized/

# Phase 1 derived team-game metrics (regenerate via `npm run
# cfb:research:derive`) — deterministic output of raw+normalized, ~56MB
# across 2018-2025. Only the small Phase 1 QA manifests are tracked.
data/cfb/research/derived/

